{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block body %}<section class="landing"><p class="eyebrow">A new way to use your SaaS</p><h1>Your video workflow.<br>Now agent ready.</h1><p class="lead">Use the familiar form, or ask your AI agent to create a video draft through the app’s browser tools.</p><div class="path-preview"><div><span class="step">01</span><h2>Describe the task</h2><p>Give your agent the video and metadata.</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span><div><span class="step">02</span><h2>Prepare visibly</h2><p>See the fields in the actual content form.</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span><div><span class="step">03</span><h2>Verify the draft</h2><p>Get a saved ID and a link you can open.</p></div></div><form method="post" action="/workspace/start"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('start_workspace') }}"><button class="primary">Start a demo workspace</button></form><p class="note">No account needed. Try the included eight-second sample, or upload an MP4 up to 20 MiB.</p><p class="note">Native WebMCP requires a compatible browser and agent client. The regular form works without it.</p></section>{% endblock %}
